## SQ-JC-01 | /dumpnotab writes the orphan list; the 5 Abnormals Delight foods are listed with a tab, escargot and maple cookie hidden
@group A
@commands boot; `/dumpnotab`; read `kubejs/exported/items/no_tab.json`; then on the instance: `python3 tools/no_tab_report.py`
@pass chat "Dumped N hidden and 5 listed"; `abnormals_delight:maple_glazed_bacon`, `cherry_cookie`, `duck_fillet`, `cooked_duck_fillet`, `duck_noodles` have `listed` true and `tab` `farmersdelight` (or the tab most Abnormals Delight items use); `escargot` and `maple_cookie` have `tab` null; no `ItemOrphanTabMixin` apply error
@fails `ItemOrphanTabMixin` (`Item.m_41471_`) not applied; `[creative_menu] orphanTabItems` missing from `config/creativecommon-common.toml` (config spec); Rhino cannot call `getRecipeFolderName`
bootreject (Mixin apply.*failed|InvalidInjectionException).*ItemOrphanTabMixin
> dumpnotab
sleep 3
shell grep -A3 -E '"id": "abnormals_delight:(maple_glazed_bacon|cherry_cookie|duck_fillet|cooked_duck_fillet|duck_noodles|escargot|maple_cookie)"' kubejs/exported/items/no_tab.json
shell grep -n 'orphanTabItems' config/creativecommon-common.toml
look the five listed with a tab, escargot and maple_cookie with tab null

## SQ-TL-10 | dict tag check runs after start and names only real problems
@group A
@commands boot; grep `logs/kubejs/server.log` (and `latest.log`) for `[dict_tag_check]`
@pass one summary line `[dict_tag_check] N dict and NCH tags checked, M empty or unknown` with N about 80 or more; every problem line names a tag that is really empty or unknown (until G2 builds Creative Delight's bone broth fluid, `fluid_dict t_bone_broth -> #forge:fluid/bone_broth` is expected); no script error from `dict_tag_check.js`; the startup log no longer has `fluid tag ... is not validated`
@fails `Registry.BIOME_REGISTRY` / `registryOrThrow` through Rhino; a block dict biome tag reported as unknown (the block -> biome -> item fallback); NCH `_fluidTagsSeen` empty (recipes ran in another script pack scope: check `global.NCH`)
waitlog \[dict_tag_check\] \d+ dict and NCH tags checked 120
shell grep -h 'dict_tag_check' logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/server.log 2>/dev/null | head -40
shell grep -c 'is not validated (tag support' logs/kubejs/startup.log; true
look the summary line, and each problem line is a real empty or unknown tag

## SQ-NCH-02 | a tag in a result slot is refused with a log line, not written as an item
@group A
@commands boot; grep `logs/kubejs/startup.log` for `in a result slot`
@pass before G2: exactly one line, `[NCH] ieBottling failed and was skipped: ieBottling ... result ...: tag "#forge:dough/wheat" in a result slot` (Creative Delight's IE bottling dough); after G2 (dough results swapped to `create:dough`): no such line; no `Unknown item '#` recipe parse error in latest.log
@fails `_itemJson` guard (neoCraftHelper.js); a new script passing a bare tag as a result (fix the script: pass the item key)
shell grep -c 'in a result slot' logs/kubejs/startup.log; true
shell grep -h 'in a result slot' logs/kubejs/startup.log | head -5
shell grep -c "Unknown item '#" logs/latest.log; true
look one dough line before G2, none after; no parse error

